    <title lang="fr">Le royaume bleu</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Deep White</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">Believe it or not, many scuba divers want to see great whites up close, and photographers want dramatic shots. But how do you get the sharks to where you want them? For decades, it's been done by baiting, or "chumming" - attracting sharks with food. This practice is being questioned and banned in many countries because of a dramatic increase in shark attacks.</desc>
    <category lang="fr">Documentaire</category>
    <icon src="http://static-cdn.tv.sfr.net/data/img/pl/2/7/0/15272072.jpg" />
