<programme channel="647f8d22a2fc3fadb4721685-5efe1de7e0b3f5003f5d9f8e" start="20261017144908 +0000" stop="20261017163958 +0000">
    <title>Blitz</title>
    <desc>A tough cop (Jason Statham) is dispatched to take down a serial killer who has been targeting police officers.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="647f8d22a2fc3fadb4721685-5efe1de7e0b3f5003f5d9f8e" start="20261017163958 +0000" stop="20261017183010 +0000">
    <title>The Contract</title>
    <desc>While on a hiking trip to reconnect with his son after the death of his wife, Ray Keene (John Cusack) stumbles into a nightmare scenario of paid assassins and ex-military guns for hire led by the mysterious Frank Carden (Morgan Freeman).</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="647f8d22a2fc3fadb4721685-5efe1de7e0b3f5003f5d9f8e" start="20261017183010 +0000" stop="20261017202215 +0000">
